---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Downtown San Jose: Preserved — PAC*SJ Walking Tour"
description: "A photo companion for the Downtown San Jose: Preserved walking tour by PAC*SJ."
---
<header class="home-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">PAC*SJ · Preservation Action Council</span>
    <h1>A tour with a purpose.<br>A repurpose.</h1>
    <p class="intro">A walking tour celebrating the historic buildings, spaces, and stories that define downtown San Jose.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="container">
  <p class="stop-list-heading">Tour Stops — in order</p>
  <ol class="stop-list">
    {% for stop in collections.stops %}
    <li>
      <a href="/stop-{{ stop.data.number }}/">
        <span class="stop-num">{{ stop.data.number | pad }}</span>
        <span class="stop-name">{{ stop.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="stop-chevron">›</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</main>
